WEBVTT

00:01.106 --> 00:04.973
Seven live radio stations, right in your voice channel.

00:05.656 --> 00:10.839
From Prague: Kiss, Rock Radio, Radio Beat, and Frekvence 1.

00:11.285 --> 00:13.729
From London, Heart and Capital.

00:13.918 --> 00:16.522
And from California, Radio Paradise.

00:17.115 --> 00:19.506
Every card shows the song on air.

00:19.708 --> 00:21.820
Hit Catch, and play it later.

00:22.676 --> 00:26.065
And on Fridays, the kitchen votes for Radio Night.

00:27.221 --> 00:29.134
And one more: Kitchen FM.

00:29.309 --> 00:31.700
Your own songs, with a DJ.

00:32.350 --> 00:35.088
🎙️ It's 9:08 PM and The Kitchen is open.

00:35.250 --> 00:39.837
🎙️ For the next few songs it's Czech rap, starting with Tram Lines by Kapsa.

00:40.000 --> 00:41.225
🎙️ Brought in by Mara.

00:42.468 --> 00:43.263
Dzbanek.

00:43.452 --> 00:44.168
Turn it up.
